{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Burgie's cozy kitchen",
    "steam_appid": 3314340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burgie's cozy kitchen is a small wholesome game about managing your own street burger joint. Enjoy its cozy and relaxed style, with a few adorably chaotic moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for your customers and upgrade your burger joint \ud83c\udf54</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Relaxing</strong>, cute, and <strong>cozy game</strong> to play at <strong>your own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Simple yet <strong>polished mechanics</strong>, <strong>all interconnected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2b Multiple <strong>secret mechanics to discover</strong> as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf42 A <strong>funny physics system</strong> that makes everything more real and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Play actively or minimize it on your desktop</strong> while you handle new orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1 <strong>4~8 hours of progressively unlockable content</strong>. Concludes with a leaderboard for those who want to continue longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play while you work or play other things \u270d</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to <strong>minimize the counter to a corner of the screen</strong> to focus on other tasks while waiting for new orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a new order comes in, a bell rings to prepare their burger and serve them as best as possible. <strong>Tips and improving your kitchen will depend on their reviews!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different game modes \ud83d\udd79</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Frantic Mode:</strong> Play actively with constant, somewhat impatient customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Relax Mode:</strong> Minimize the game, attending to customers every 5-15 minutes, and <strong>brighten your day with short breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Pomodoro Mode:</strong> Minimize the game, <strong>set the timer</strong>, and a new customer will notify you when it's time to take a break. <strong>Ideal as a gamified concentration tool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd29 <strong>Streamer Mode:</strong> Combine any of the above modes with your stream. <strong>Viewers can play through your livestream chat</strong> with a simple command and place the craziest order they can think of. <strong>They'll also complain if you mess up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with your chat: Integration with Twitch, YouTube, Kick, and Tiktok chat \ud83d\udcac</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can connect the game to your <strong>YouTube, Kick, Tiktok, or Twitch chat</strong> to receive your own viewers and their orders. <strong>You can chat individually with each of them</strong>, serve them any food you want, and much more! They'll also affect your reviews, helping (or not) you climb the global Streamers ranking.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burgie's cozy kitchen is a small wholesome game about managing your own street burger joint. Enjoy its cozy and relaxed style, with a few adorably chaotic moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for your customers and upgrade your burger joint \ud83c\udf54</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Relaxing</strong>, cute, and <strong>cozy game</strong> to play at <strong>your own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Simple yet <strong>polished mechanics</strong>, <strong>all interconnected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2b Multiple <strong>secret mechanics to discover</strong> as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf42 A <strong>funny physics system</strong> that makes everything more real and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Play actively or minimize it on your desktop</strong> while you handle new orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1 <strong>4~8 hours of progressively unlockable content</strong>. Concludes with a leaderboard for those who want to continue longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play while you work or play other things \u270d</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to <strong>minimize the counter to a corner of the screen</strong> to focus on other tasks while waiting for new orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a new order comes in, a bell rings to prepare their burger and serve them as best as possible. <strong>Tips and improving your kitchen will depend on their reviews!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different game modes \ud83d\udd79</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Frantic Mode:</strong> Play actively with constant, somewhat impatient customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Relax Mode:</strong> Minimize the game, attending to customers every 5-15 minutes, and <strong>brighten your day with short breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Pomodoro Mode:</strong> Minimize the game, <strong>set the timer</strong>, and a new customer will notify you when it's time to take a break. <strong>Ideal as a gamified concentration tool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd29 <strong>Streamer Mode:</strong> Combine any of the above modes with your stream. <strong>Viewers can play through your livestream chat</strong> with a simple command and place the craziest order they can think of. <strong>They'll also complain if you mess up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with your chat: Integration with Twitch, YouTube, Kick, and Tiktok chat \ud83d\udcac</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.poster.avif?t=1752344159\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.webm?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.mp4?t=1752344159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can connect the game to your <strong>YouTube, Kick, Tiktok, or Twitch chat</strong> to receive your own viewers and their orders. <strong>You can chat individually with each of them</strong>, serve them any food you want, and much more! They'll also affect your reviews, helping (or not) you climb the global Streamers ranking.</p>",
    "short_description": "Manage a small burger joint in this adorable and chaotic idle cooking game. Play actively or use it a desktop companion while you work on your stuff. \u2728Brighten your day with little breaks! Includes Pomodoro focus tool and stream integration to play with your chat.",
